{"seq":3,"slug":"query-optimization-limits-oom","title":"查询优化与防护：索引选择、超时控制与 OOM 治理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/timeseries-database-prometheus-tsdb-storage-engine/query-promql-execution/query-optimization-limits-oom","wordCount":2122,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"查询优化与防护-索引选择-超时控制与-oom-治理\">查询优化与防护：索引选择、超时控制与 OOM 治理</h1><p>一次 <code>rate(http_requests_total[5m])</code> 从提交到返回，Prometheus 先把它解析成表达式树，再对每个向量选择器调用存储层的 <code>Select</code>，由倒排索引算出候选序列集合，最后只对命中的序列读取 chunk、解码、在步进网格上求值。这条链路上任何一环放大——matcher 写得不够窄、步长太小、序列数太多——都会把成本从「毫秒」推到「内存溢出」。本文只谈这条链路的成本来源与防护手段：索引如何被 matcher 选择、样本数如何换算成内存、以及超时 / 并发 / 样本上限三层门控和查询前端的 OOM 治理套路。求值语义本身见同 hub 的 <a href=\"evaluation-engine-functions-aggregation\">求值引擎：步进求值、函数、聚合与子查询</a>，选择器的匹配规则见 <a href=\"promql-vector-selector-semantics\">PromQL 向量选择器与语义</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>Matcher（匹配器）</strong>：<code>label=&quot;v&quot;</code>（eq）、<code>label!=&quot;v&quot;</code>（neq）、<code>label=~&quot;re&quot;</code>（re）、<code>label!~&quot;re&quot;</code>（nre）四类，是索引选择能力的唯一输入。</li>\n<li><strong>Postings</strong>：倒排索引里每个 <code>(label,value)</code> 对应一个有序序列 ID 列表；<code>Select</code> 的成本≈对各 postings 做交集/并集的规模。</li>\n<li><strong>候选集（Series Set）</strong>：索引给出的、满足全部 matcher 的序列集合；之后的 chunk 解码和内存占用都正比于它。</li>\n<li><strong>样本数（Samples）</strong>：成本与内存的真实计量单位，约等于 <code>候选序列数 × 每序列点数</code>，而不是时间跨度。</li>\n<li><strong>三层防护</strong>：超时（<code>--query.timeout</code>）、并发（<code>--query.max-concurrency</code>）、样本上限（<code>--query.max-samples</code>）。</li>\n<li><strong>查询前端（Query Frontend）</strong>：Thanos / Cortex / Grafana Mimir 中位于查询入口、做分片、缓存与限流的组件——单机 Prometheus 没有它，这正是单机 OOM 的根因之一。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"索引选择-matcher-类型决定要扫多少-postings\">索引选择：matcher 类型决定要扫多少 postings</h2><p><code>Select</code> 的第一步不是读数据，而是把 matcher 翻译成 postings 操作。四类 matcher 的选择性天差地别：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Matcher</th>\n<th>语法</th>\n<th>索引层的操作</th>\n<th>选择性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>等值</td>\n<td><code>job=&quot;api&quot;</code></td>\n<td>直接取该 postings</td>\n<td>最高，可精确收敛</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>不等</td>\n<td><code>job!=&quot;api&quot;</code></td>\n<td>取该 label 全部 postings，再减去等值集合</td>\n<td>差，需全量 label 枚举</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>正则 =~</td>\n<td><code>job=~&quot;api|web&quot;</code></td>\n<td>展开为多个等值后并集（若能枚举）或全扫 label 值</td>\n<td>取决于能否收敛成有限集合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>正则 !~</td>\n<td><code>job!~&quot;.*debug.*&quot;</code></td>\n<td>全扫 label 值再排除</td>\n<td>最差，近似全表</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一条经验规则：<strong>至少给出一个高选择性的等值 matcher</strong>（通常是 <code>__name__</code>、<code>job</code>、<code>instance</code>、<code>namespace</code>）。<code>{__name__=~&quot;.+&quot;}</code> 或 <code>{job=~&quot;.*&quot;}</code> 会让索引退化成枚举所有序列，是 OOM 的头号来源。Prometheus 官方在「Storage」文档中明确：matcher 越多、越具体，<code>Select</code> 越省——索引倒排的意义就在于把「扫描所有序列」变成「对几个 postings 做交集」。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    E[表达式树] --&gt; S[遍历向量选择器]&#10;    S --&gt; M[收集 matchers]&#10;    M --&gt; EQ{有等值 matcher?}&#10;    EQ --&gt;|是| P1[取等值 postings]&#10;    EQ --&gt;|否| P2[枚举 label 全值集]&#10;    P1 --&gt; INT[postings 交集]&#10;    P2 --&gt; INT&#10;    INT --&gt; NEG[减去 neq / nre 集合]&#10;    NEG --&gt; SS[候选序列集合]&#10;    SS --&gt; CH[逐序列读 chunk 解码]&#10;    CH --&gt; EV[步进网格求值]&#10;    EV --&gt; RS[结果向量 / 矩阵]\">graph TD\n    E[表达式树] --&gt; S[遍历向量选择器]\n    S --&gt; M[收集 matchers]\n    M --&gt; EQ{有等值 matcher?}\n    EQ --&gt;|是| P1[取等值 postings]\n    EQ --&gt;|否| P2[枚举 label 全值集]\n    P1 --&gt; INT[postings 交集]\n    P2 --&gt; INT\n    INT --&gt; NEG[减去 neq / nre 集合]\n    NEG --&gt; SS[候选序列集合]\n    SS --&gt; CH[逐序列读 chunk 解码]\n    CH --&gt; EV[步进网格求值]\n    EV --&gt; RS[结果向量 / 矩阵]</pre><p>在 Thanos、Mimir 这类多租户系统里，matcher 还会被下推到各 store 或 ingester：查询前端把「一个查询」切成多个按时间或按序列哈希的子查询（query sharding），每个子查询带着同一组 matcher 去各自的倒排索引里取交集。matcher 越窄，每个分片要读的 postings 越少，分片并行才真正有效；否则分片只是把一次大 OOM 拆成多个小 OOM。</p>\n<h2 id=\"求值成本模型-样本数才是内存的真正单位\">求值成本模型：样本数才是内存的真正单位</h2><p>排查 OOM 时最容易误判的是「时间跨度」。真正决定内存的是求值产生的样本数：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>samples</mtext></msub><mo>≈</mo><munder><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>候选序列数</mtext></munder><mo>×</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mtext>step</mtext></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>×</mo><munder><munder><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>每点读取的样本数</mtext></munder></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{\\text{samples}} \\approx \\underbrace{|S|}_{\\text{候选序列数}} \\times \\left(\\frac{t_{end}-t_{start}}{\\text{step}} + 1\\right) \\times \\underbrace{k}_{\\text{每点读取的样本数}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">samples</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3263em;vertical-align:-1.5763em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.4237em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">候选序列数</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.102em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"stretchy\" style=\"height:0.548em;min-width:1.6em;\"><span class=\"brace-left\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 6l6-6h17c12.688 0 19.313.3 20 1 4 4 7.313 8.3 10 13\n 35.313 51.3 80.813 93.8 136.5 127.5 55.688 33.7 117.188 55.8 184.5 66.5.688\n 0 2 .3 4 1 18.688 2.7 76 4.3 172 5h399450v120H429l-6-1c-124.688-8-235-61.7\n-331-161C60.687 138.7 32.312 99.3 7 54L0 41V6z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-center\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMin slice\"><path d=\"M199572 214\nc100.7 8.3 195.3 44 280 108 55.3 42 101.7 93 139 153l9 14c2.7-4 5.7-8.7 9-14\n 53.3-86.7 123.7-153 211-199 66.7-36 137.3-56.3 212-62h199568v120H200432c-178.3\n 11.7-311.7 78.3-403 201-6 8-9.7 12-11 12-.7.7-6.7 1-18 1s-17.3-.3-18-1c-1.3 0\n-5-4-11-12-44.7-59.3-101.3-106.3-170-141s-145.3-54.3-229-60H0V214z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-right\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M399994 0l6 6v35l-6 11c-56 104-135.3 181.3-238 232-57.3\n 28.7-117 45-179 50H-300V214h399897c43.3-7 81-15 113-26 100.7-33 179.7-91 237\n-174 2.7-5 6-9 10-13 .7-1 7.3-1 20-1h17z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.898em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5763em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2921em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">step</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0208em;vertical-align:-1.3263em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.6737em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">每点读取的样本数</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.352em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"stretchy\" style=\"height:0.548em;min-width:1.6em;\"><span class=\"brace-left\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 6l6-6h17c12.688 0 19.313.3 20 1 4 4 7.313 8.3 10 13\n 35.313 51.3 80.813 93.8 136.5 127.5 55.688 33.7 117.188 55.8 184.5 66.5.688\n 0 2 .3 4 1 18.688 2.7 76 4.3 172 5h399450v120H429l-6-1c-124.688-8-235-61.7\n-331-161C60.687 138.7 32.312 99.3 7 54L0 41V6z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-center\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMin slice\"><path d=\"M199572 214\nc100.7 8.3 195.3 44 280 108 55.3 42 101.7 93 139 153l9 14c2.7-4 5.7-8.7 9-14\n 53.3-86.7 123.7-153 211-199 66.7-36 137.3-56.3 212-62h199568v120H200432c-178.3\n 11.7-311.7 78.3-403 201-6 8-9.7 12-11 12-.7.7-6.7 1-18 1s-17.3-.3-18-1c-1.3 0\n-5-4-11-12-44.7-59.3-101.3-106.3-170-141s-145.3-54.3-229-60H0V214z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-right\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M399994 0l6 6v35l-6 11c-56 104-135.3 181.3-238 232-57.3\n 28.7-117 45-179 50H-300V214h399897c43.3-7 81-15 113-26 100.7-33 179.7-91 237\n-174 2.7-5 6-9 10-13 .7-1 7.3-1 20-1h17z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.648em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3263em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|S|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span> 是索引给出的候选集大小，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 与函数窗口有关：<code>rate(x[5m])</code> 在 15s 抓取间隔下每点要读约 20 个原始样本，<code>sum by ()(...)</code> 则把多序列聚合成一条。三点推论：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>step 越小，点越多</strong>。一个跨 7 天、步长 1s 的查询产生约 60 万个点左右——UI 自动降采样到像素级，但 HTTP API 不会，脚本里写 <code>step=1s</code> 是最常见的自伤。</li>\n<li><strong>窗口越大，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 越大</strong>。<code>rate(x[7d])</code> 哪怕只算一个点，也要解码 7 天窗口内的全部样本。</li>\n<li><strong><code>|S|</code> 由 matcher 和后端基数共同决定</strong>。高基数 label（如把 <code>request_id</code>、<code>pod_uid</code> 当 label）会让 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|S|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span> 爆炸，此时再窄的 matcher 也可能命中十万级序列。基数治理见同 hub 的 <a href=\"../cardinality-operate-scale/\">高基数与规模化运维</a>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Prometheus 内部用 <code>--query.max-samples</code> 直接对 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>samples</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{\\text{samples}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">samples</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 设上限，超限时返回 <code>query processing would load too many samples into memory</code>，而不是把机器打挂——这是成本模型被显式写进引擎的证据。</p>\n<h2 id=\"超时-并发与样本上限-三层防护\">超时、并发与样本上限：三层防护</h2><p>单机 Prometheus 通过三个命令行标志把查询资源封顶，默认值即为官方出厂护栏：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>标志</th>\n<th>默认值</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n<th>超限行为</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>--query.timeout</code></td>\n<td><code>2m</code></td>\n<td>单查询墙钟超时</td>\n<td>返回 <code>query timeout exceeded</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>--query.max-concurrency</code></td>\n<td><code>20</code></td>\n<td>同时执行的查询数</td>\n<td>多余请求排队等待</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>--query.max-samples</code></td>\n<td><code>50000000</code>（5e7）</td>\n<td>单查询加载样本数上限</td>\n<td>报 too many samples，中止</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>--query.lookback-delta</code></td>\n<td><code>5m</code></td>\n<td>实例选择器回看窗口</td>\n<td>影响旧值前向填充，间接放大 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>--query.active-query-path</code></td>\n<td><code>queries.active</code></td>\n<td>活跃查询落盘目录</td>\n<td>供排查慢查询与 OOM 现场</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>三者组合的语义值得分开看：<strong>超时是墙钟</strong>，防的是慢查询长期占住内存；<strong>并发上限是队列深度</strong>，防的是大量中等查询同时展开把内存叠乘；<strong>样本上限是硬闸</strong>，在内存尚未分配前就拒绝。生产上如果只调一个，优先确保 <code>--query.max-samples</code> 有值——它是唯一能在内存分配前拦截的手段。</p>\n<p>需要注意 <code>--query.max-concurrency</code> 的排队只发生在单机入口；在 Thanos / Mimir 里，配额由 <code>-querier.max-query-parallelism</code> 与 <code>-query-frontend</code> 的每租户 limits（如 Mimir 的 <code>max_fetched_samples</code>、<code>max_fetched_series</code>）控制，见 Grafana Mimir 的「Configuration reference」。这也是为什么托管 SaaSS 型指标服务几乎都强制给每个租户设 <code>max_fetched_*</code>：单机标志只保护自身，多租户必须按租户封顶。</p>\n<h2 id=\"oom-治理-从垂直分片到查询前端的工程手段\">OOM 治理：从垂直分片到查询前端的工程手段</h2><p>当默认护栏不够用时，业界形成了从「改查询」到「改架构」的四级应对：</p>\n<p><strong>第一级：把查询改窄。</strong> 缩小时间范围、放大 step、把 <code>{__name__=~&quot;.+&quot;}</code> 换成等值 matcher、用 <code>sum by ()</code> 尽早聚合掉维度。这一级零成本，应最先做。</p>\n<p><strong>第二级：预计算。</strong> 用 recording rules 把高频、重成本的聚合提前算好落到低基数指标，查询端只读聚合结果。Thanos 与 Mimir 的文档都把 recording rules 列为降低查询内存的首选——把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|S|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span> 从十万级降到百级。</p>\n<p><strong>第三级：垂直分片（vertical sharding）。</strong> 单机 Prometheus 无法把一个查询拆开，但可以通过 <code>hashmod</code> relabel 把同一组指标按标签哈希分散到多个 Prometheus 实例，每个实例的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|S|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span> 缩小若干倍，查询端再从联邦或 Thanos 汇聚。代价是查询要跨实例合并。</p>\n<p><strong>第四级：查询前端分片与缓存。</strong> Thanos Query Frontend 与 Mimir 把查询按 <code>-query-frontend.split-queries-by-interval</code> 切成时间片、按序列哈希切成 shard，并行下发到多个 querier，并对 <code>(查询, 时间片)</code> 结果做缓存（<code>-query-frontend.results-cache-ttl</code>）。这既降单查询内存峰值，又通过对重复查询命中缓存降低总体负载。Mimir 的 query-scheduler 进一步把分片任务排队，防止某个大租户挤占全部 querier。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    C[客户端] --&gt; QF[Query Frontend]&#10;    QF --&gt; SP{查询分片}&#10;    SP --&gt;|按时间切| Q1[Querier A]&#10;    SP --&gt;|按序列哈希| Q2[Querier B]&#10;    SP --&gt;|按序列哈希| Q3[Querier C]&#10;    QF --&gt; RC[(结果缓存)]&#10;    RC --&gt; QF&#10;    Q1 --&gt; ST[(Store Gateway / TSDB)]&#10;    Q2 --&gt; ST&#10;    Q3 --&gt; ST&#10;    Q1 --&gt; MRG[合并结果]&#10;    Q2 --&gt; MRG&#10;    Q3 --&gt; MRG&#10;    MRG --&gt; C\">graph TD\n    C[客户端] --&gt; QF[Query Frontend]\n    QF --&gt; SP{查询分片}\n    SP --&gt;|按时间切| Q1[Querier A]\n    SP --&gt;|按序列哈希| Q2[Querier B]\n    SP --&gt;|按序列哈希| Q3[Querier C]\n    QF --&gt; RC[(结果缓存)]\n    RC --&gt; QF\n    Q1 --&gt; ST[(Store Gateway / TSDB)]\n    Q2 --&gt; ST\n    Q3 --&gt; ST\n    Q1 --&gt; MRG[合并结果]\n    Q2 --&gt; MRG\n    Q3 --&gt; MRG\n    MRG --&gt; C</pre><p>一条实践红线：<strong>分片不能替代基数治理</strong>。如果 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|S|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span> 本身是十万级，把查询切成 64 片只是把「一次性 OOM」变成「64 个分片各自接近上限」，总量反而更大。分片的前提是 matcher 已经把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|S|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span> 收敛到可接受范围。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>查询成本的可控性由三个量共同决定：matcher 的选择性决定了索引要扫多少 postings 和候选集 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|S|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span> 的规模，step 与窗口决定了每序列的点数与每点样本数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span>，二者的乘积就是 <code>--query.max-samples</code> 度量的样本数。超时、并发、样本上限三层门控分别对应「时间」「并发度」「内存闸」三个不同维度，不能互相替代。架构侧的四级手段（改窄查询、预计算、垂直分片、查询前端分片与缓存）按代价从低到高排列，但都建立在同一个前提上——先把高基数压下去。反过来，任何绕过基数治理的「加机器 / 加分片」都只是在推迟下一次 OOM。</p>\n<h2 id=\"落地清单\">落地清单</h2><ul>\n<li>每个查询至少带一个高选择性等值 matcher，禁用 <code>{__name__=~&quot;.+&quot;}</code> 这类全枚举。</li>\n<li>显式设 <code>--query.max-samples</code>，让它成为内存分配前的硬闸；超时要与调用方超时留出余量。</li>\n<li><code>--query.max-concurrency</code> 按机器核数与内存标定，勿随意调大到数百。</li>\n<li>高频重查询一律转 recording rules，把查询侧的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|S|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 同时压低。</li>\n<li>多实例部署优先用 query frontend 做时间/序列分片与结果缓存，而不是单纯堆机器。</li>\n<li>高基数 label 从摄取端治理（relabel drop），因为查询侧的任何优化都救不回失控的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|S|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"查询优化与防护：索引选择、超时控制与 OOM 治理","id":"查询优化与防护-索引选择-超时控制与-oom-治理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"索引选择：matcher 类型决定要扫多少 postings","id":"索引选择-matcher-类型决定要扫多少-postings"},{"level":2,"text":"求值成本模型：样本数才是内存的真正单位","id":"求值成本模型-样本数才是内存的真正单位"},{"level":2,"text":"超时、并发与样本上限：三层防护","id":"超时-并发与样本上限-三层防护"},{"level":2,"text":"OOM 治理：从垂直分片到查询前端的工程手段","id":"oom-治理-从垂直分片到查询前端的工程手段"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"落地清单","id":"落地清单"}],"prev":{"title":"求值引擎：步进求值、函数、聚合与子查询","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/timeseries-database-prometheus-tsdb-storage-engine/query-promql-execution/evaluation-engine-functions-aggregation"},"next":{"title":"高基数根因与度量：series 爆炸来源与 TSDB status 分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/timeseries-database-prometheus-tsdb-storage-engine/cardinality-operate-scale/cardinality-source-measurement"}}